WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.323
Unit twenty-one. Talking About Worries!

2
00:00:04.276 --> 00:00:08.016
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:11.443
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.493 --> 00:00:15.538
Today we learn about Talking About Worries. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.441 --> 00:00:19.824
Worry. Say it with me. Worry!

6
00:00:23.332 --> 00:00:26.532
Talk. Say it with me. Talk!

7
00:00:30.028 --> 00:00:33.212
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

8
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.970
Parent. Say it with me. Parent!

9
00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:46.987
Teacher. Say it with me. Teacher!

10
00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:54.072
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

11
00:00:57.575 --> 00:01:01.258
Feel better. Say it with me. Feel better!

12
00:01:04.741 --> 00:01:07.841
Help. Say it with me. Help!

13
00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:19.748
Sometimes I have a worry. Talking to a parent or teacher I trust helps me feel better. They listen and help me find a way to fix the problem.

14
00:01:19.797 --> 00:01:21.014
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.429 --> 00:01:27.439
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.489 --> 00:01:28.639
Trust!

17
00:01:29.429 --> 00:01:34.602
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.652 --> 00:01:35.802
Feel better!

19
00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:42.227
Did you know? Sharing a worry with someone you trust can make it feel smaller!

20
00:01:42.277 --> 00:01:44.133
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:44.824 --> 00:01:52.541
Think and answer. Who do you talk to when you have a worry?

22
00:01:52.591 --> 00:01:53.741
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.961 --> 00:01:59.810
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.505
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

